# assistente utile U12 (docs/plans/assistente-utile.md) — una quantita' per
# periodo, per quanti periodi: tre pezzi del turno e la conversione della durata
# con quantity/3, tutto in KB (numeric-questions.p0 §4).
[mock live]
!set PARROT0_SESSION=
!set PARROT0_PROFILE=kb/profiles/agi.p0
!set PARROT0_LANG=en
!reset

[test a monthly saving over years converts the duration]
!timeout 30
> If I save 50 euros a month, how much will I have in two years?
< 1200 euros.

[test the same over months, and a daily cost over weeks]
!timeout 30
> I save 50 euros every month. How much do I save in 24 months?
< 1200 euros.
> I spend 3 euros a day on coffee. How much do I spend in 2 weeks?
< 42 euros.
